Problem: Ranking Most Active Guests
Platform: StrataScratch | Difficulty: Medium
Window Function Used: DENSE_RANK()
Key Logic: Sum messages per guest, apply DENSE_RANK globally ordered by total desc so ties share the same rank

-- SOLUTION
SELECT
    id_guest,
    SUM(n_messages) AS total_messages,
    DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY SUM(n_messages) DESC) AS rank
FROM airbnb_contacts
GROUP BY id_guest
ORDER BY total_messages DESC;
